title Architecture Detection Flow

participant "Discovery Pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "ArchitectureDetector" as Detector
participant "Module Analyzer" as Module

note over Pipeline, Detector: === Phase 1: Module Discovery ===

Pipeline->Detector: detectStack()
activate Detector

Detector->Detector: Check settings.gradle.kts
Detector->Detector: Check pom.xml
Detector->Detector: Parse module declarations

alt Gradle multi-module found
    Detector->Detector: Extract module names from settings.gradle
    note right of Detector: Gradle modules:\n- core:orchestrator\n- core:session\n- launcher\n- etc.
else Maven multi-module found
    Detector->Detector: Extract module names from pom.xml
    note right of Detector: Maven modules:\n- module1\n- module2\n- module3
else Single module
    Detector->Detector: Treat as single module project
    note right of Detector: Single module:\n- root module
end

loop For each module
    Detector->Module: analyzeModule(modulePath, moduleName)
    activate Module
    Module->Module: Detect primary language
    Module->Module: Detect frameworks (Spring Boot, Ktor, React, etc.)
    Module->Module: Detect platforms (Backend, Frontend, CLI, etc.)
    Module-->Detector: Module(name, language, frameworks, platforms)
    deactivate Module
end

Detector-->Pipeline: List<Module>

note over Pipeline, Detector: === Phase 2: Technology Stack Aggregation ===

Detector->Detector: Aggregate languages from all modules
Detector->Detector: Determine primary language (most common)
Detector->Detector: Collect secondary languages
Detector->Detector: Aggregate frameworks (distinct across modules)
Detector->Detector: Aggregate platforms (distinct across modules)
Detector->Detector: Detect architecture patterns (based on modules)
Detector->Detector: Build entry point patterns
Detector->Detector: Calculate overall confidence (0.0 - 1.0)
Detector->Detector: Collect detection indicators

note right of Detector: TechnologyStack:\n  primaryLanguage\n  secondaryLanguages\n  frameworks\n  platforms\n  patterns\n  modules\n  entryPointPatterns\n  confidence\n  indicators

Detector->Detector: TechnologyStack(\n  primaryLanguage,\n  secondaryLanguages,\n  frameworks,\n  platforms,\n  patterns,\n  modules,\n  entryPointPatterns,\n  confidence,\n  indicators\n)
Detector-->Pipeline: TechnologyStack
deactivate Detector

note over Pipeline, Detector: === Phase 3: Pattern Detection ===

Pipeline->Pipeline: Analyze module structure
Pipeline->Pipeline: Check for multiple modules with independence
Pipeline->Pipeline: Assess module dependencies
Pipeline->Pipeline: Evaluate cluster count

alt Single module
    Pipeline->Pipeline: MONOLITH pattern
else Multiple independent modules
    Pipeline->Pipeline: MICROSERVICES pattern
else Multiple dependent modules
    Pipeline->Pipeline: MODULAR_MONOLITH pattern
end

Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate architecture-detection.yaml
Pipeline->Pipeline: Save to semantic cache
Pipeline-->Pipeline: Architecture detection complete
